<title>USA: HomeCorp to split stock three-for-two.</title>
<headline>HomeCorp to split stock three-for-two.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>HomeCorp Inc said Tuesday its board of directors declared a three-for-two stock split.</p>
<p>The split is payable on or about May 30 to shareholders of record May 9, the thrift holding company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
